      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's hear the beginning of his thoughts.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Люди часто спят.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'People often sleep.' A metaphor for not paying attention.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Они не хотят думать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They do not want to think.' It is easier to avoid hard thoughts.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Все любят мечтать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone loves to dream.' Dreaming is a safe place.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы видим сны.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We see dreams.' We live in a world of our own imagination.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Такая у нас жизнь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Such is our life.' This is how many people exist.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Никто не видит правду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody sees the truth.' The reality is hidden from us.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We.' A powerful single word to summarize humanity.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Многие закрывают глаза.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Many close their eyes.' We ignore the obvious signs around us.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Они боятся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are afraid.' Fear keeps us from acting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Просто ждут чудо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just wait for a miracle.' Waiting for something to happen automatically.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Никто ничего не знает.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody knows anything.' Ignorance is bliss in a complicated world.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "И все молчат.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And everyone is silent.' We do not speak up when we should. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
